{"id":"c2da0adcaefcf021","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-effective-oracle-axioms.md","title":"相容 c.e. 公理集编译为 oracle 程序","display":"thm-effective-oracle-axioms — 相容 c.e. 公理集编译为 oracle 程序","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-effective-oracle-axioms","aliases":["20-thm-effective-oracle-axioms"],"display":"thm-effective-oracle-axioms — 相容 c.e. 公理集编译为 oracle 程序","chapter":"3","section":"3.3.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 3.3.8；§5.5.3","source_printed_pages":[56,123,124],"source_pdf_pages":[92,158,159],"depends_on":["[[20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms]]","[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-effective-oracle-axioms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-effective-oracle-axioms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-effective-oracle-axioms — 相容 c.e. 公理集编译为 oracle 程序"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.3.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 3.3.8；§5.5.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56</span><span>123</span><span>124</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92</span><span>158</span><span>159</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c803835be7de786d\" href=\"?note=c803835be7de786d\" title=\"20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms\">20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的编码为 c.e. 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Consistent}(G)\">\\(\\operatorname{Consistent}(G)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c803835be7de786d\" href=\"?note=c803835be7de786d\" title=\"20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms\">20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}effective-oracle-axioms}\\vdash\n\\exists e\\ \\forall A,x,y\\ [\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow\\Psi_G^A(x)\\downarrow=y].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}effective-oracle-axioms}\\vdash\n\\exists e\\ \\forall A,x,y\\ [\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow\\Psi_G^A(x)\\downarrow=y].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>程序逐项枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>，对每条公理询问有限串内的 oracle 位；首条匹配公理决定输出。若有匹配，它终会被枚举；若没有，程序一直搜索。相容性排除同一 oracle 和输入的不同输出。程序索引可由公理集的枚举索引统一编译。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 3.3.8；§5.5.3；印刷页 56, 123, 124；PDF 第 92, 158, 159 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"c803835be7de786d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"c803835be7de786d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Consistent}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}effective-oracle-axioms}\\vdash\n\\exists e\\ \\forall A,x,y\\ [\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow\\Psi_G^A(x)\\downarrow=y].","display":true},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1404,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["c803835be7de786d","140cce30ee9c16d1"]}